      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "We have started an independent conversation with the Memento team, and what Marmotta has already done is not as interesting as what we are going to do directly with that Memento team. We will take up the question of interoperability amongst LDP impls in the LDPNext venue.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
